Subject: [PATCH] Add vision relay: a chosen vision model describes images for
 the chat model

- ollama.describe_image(); files.build_history(vision_model=...) with per-attachment cache
- views: accept vision_model on /send/ and /agent/send/
- Settings: "Image reader (vision model)" dropdown (vision-capable models only)
- CHANGES.md: document

